Subject: [PATCH] Include the out-of-process helpers in the 6000.0 Windows build

6000.0 has not yet added oop.c to common_sources. Later Unity 6 streams include it
upstream; this compatibility patch belongs only to the older stream.

diff --git a/mono/metadata/Makefile.am b/mono/metadata/Makefile.am
--- a/mono/metadata/Makefile.am
+++ b/mono/metadata/Makefile.am
@@ -14,4 +14,5 @@ win32_sources = \
 	w32event-win32.c \
 	w32process-win32.c \
+	oop.c \
 	w32socket-win32.c \
 	w32error-win32.c
